SCOPE

This dedication covers the Japanese translations, the site code, and the
ingest and translation tooling in this repository.

The English source texts — the Ante-Nicene Fathers and Nicene and Post-Nicene
Fathers series (1885-1900) — are already in the public domain by age and are
not covered by, nor affected by, this dedication.
